title: How It Works | Smoke Alarm Installation Christchurch
metaDescription: "How smoke alarm installation works with us — quick quote, one tidy visit, alarms tested and paperwork emailed same day. Most Christchurch homes done in under an hour. Call 0800 120 046."
imgKey: how-it-works
heroTitle: How It Works
heroLead: No site visits to quote, no half-day windows, no drama. Here's the whole process from first call to tested alarms — most homes are done and dusted in under an hour.
breadcrumb: How It Works
faqs:
  - q: "Do you need to visit before quoting?"
    a: "Almost never. Bedrooms, levels, and whether you've got existing hardwired alarms — that's enough for a fixed price on the phone or by email. The rare exceptions are complicated interconnected retrofits or commercial spaces, and we'll say so upfront rather than surprise you."
  - q: "Do I need to be home for the install?"
    a: "Someone over 18 needs to let us in and ideally walk the house with us for two minutes at the start — placement decisions are better with the person who lives there. After that, put the kettle on and leave us to it. For rentals we coordinate directly with tenants."
  - q: "What payment do you take?"
    a: "Bank transfer, credit card or EFTPOS on the day. Landlords and property managers get invoiced with normal terms. The amount is whatever we quoted — fixed means fixed."
  - q: "What if something's not right after you leave?"
    a: "Call us and we'll come back, no charge, no quibbling. Our alarms carry manufacturer warranties and our workmanship is guaranteed — a false-alarming unit or a placement worry is our problem to fix, not yours to live with."
